      "text": [
        "Weekly Timetable",
        "Classes for every stage of practice",
        "All classes run in small groups at our Harrogate studio. Mats and props are provided — just bring yourself.",
        "Slow Flow",
        "A gentle, breath-led class ideal for stiff mornings, recovering bodies, or anyone who prefers ease over intensity.",
        "Mondays · 9:30am & Thursdays · 6:00pm",
        "Hatha Yoga",
        "Traditional postures held with care, paired with pranayama and a proper ten-minute relaxation at the close.",
        "Tuesdays · 6:15pm & Saturdays · 9:00am",
        "Vinyasa Flow",
        "A more dynamic, linked-breath class for those with some experience who want to build strength and stamina.",
        "Wednesdays · 6:15pm",
        "Yin & Restore",
        "Long-held, supported poses to release deep tension. The perfect antidote to a desk-bound week.",
        "Thursdays · 7:30pm",
        "Yoga for Healthy Ageing",
        "A steady, chair-optional class focused on balance, joint mobility, and staying independent for longer.",
        "Fridays · 10:30am",
        "Beginners' Course",
        "Our six-week foundation course — see below for details. New intakes start every half-term.",
        "Mondays · 6:00pm (new course starting soon)"
      ]
    },
