      "text": [
        "Kind Words",
        "What our students say",
        "\"I put off trying yoga for years, convinced I'd be the least flexible person in the room. The beginners' course put that fear to bed within the first session.\"",
        "— Fiona T., Beginners' Course",
        "\"Small class sizes make all the difference. Eleanor notices if you're struggling with a pose and adjusts before you even ask.\"",
        "— Michael R., Slow Flow",
        "\"The Yin class on a Thursday evening is the best hour of my week. I leave feeling like I've had a proper reset.\"",
        "— Priya S., Yin & Restore"
      ]
    },
